# Release Notes *3.2.0*
<Now/>

## Summary
- __Zero-lag saving__
- Improved equations/objects - mixed content rendering
- __x8 faster initial evaluation kernel launch__
- __Faster exports, x2 faster 2D, 3D graphics, audio streaming__
- __x<ToExpression>74/0.01//Round</ToExpression> faster Javascript to WL pipeline__ (you can literally stream raw video directly from JS to Wolfram)
- Better Dialog API
- Access to server logs from the app, Kernel crashing detection
- Caching improvements
- Fixed race conditions bugs in MCP server
- Better internal architecture, __fully refactored in 3 sweeps__
- __More integration tests (> 200)__
- Small and tight frontend-backend API, binary-based protocol

