# Release Notes *3.2.0*
Wed 14 Oct 2026 15:27:17

## Summary
- __Zero-lag saving__
- Improved equations/objects - mixed content rendering
- __x8 faster initial evaluation kernel launch__
- __Faster exports, x2 faster 2D, 3D graphics, audio streaming__
