- Access to server logs from the app, Kernel crashing detection
- Caching improvements
- Fixed race conditions bugs in MCP server
- Better internal architecture, __fully refactored in 3 sweeps__
- __More integration tests (> 200)__
- Small and tight frontend-backend API, binary-based protocol

